{"steam_appid":5266240,"steam_name":"Potato Please","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/5266240/509884207/1b5aac1695a6c37620d676eca9c910121ecf4e34/1793709478/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793717977","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257490024/d395be04abcf6ce3b0812b518fccf10bb26dc347/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793717977","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/e570cff7a205de985b4cf4be1227a844daeba913/ss_e570cff7a205de985b4cf4be1227a844daeba913.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793891257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/ba165529f1e1e51617e4f7d77e4002848dd16cb0/ss_ba165529f1e1e51617e4f7d77e4002848dd16cb0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793891257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/8092eb01f00c8904619d69b36b410e62a99a464d/ss_8092eb01f00c8904619d69b36b410e62a99a464d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793891257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/417c17c016cfdf5d4485657ace9710e4cff7a0b7/ss_417c17c016cfdf5d4485657ace9710e4cff7a0b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793891257","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/013c1d7c7004ea8b36c9c2a0492da94b08c9c905/ss_013c1d7c7004ea8b36c9c2a0492da94b08c9c905.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793891257"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, Comrade. The nation has entrusted you with a vital responsibility: keeping the army fed. Peel the potatoes, prepare the supply, and improve your operation in service of the greater good. Work hard, work efficiently, and remember: the army is hungry.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.poster.avif?t=1793891257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.webm?t=1793891257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.mp4?t=1793891257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>PEEL THE POTATOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple: peel the potatoes and get them into the water.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick them up, peel them by hand, and toss them in one by one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.poster.avif?t=1793891257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.webm?t=1793891257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.mp4?t=1793891257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FINISH THE PILE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear the pile and find faster ways to get the job done.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as manual work gradually turns into a much more efficient operation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.poster.avif?t=1793891257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.webm?t=1793891257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5266240/extras/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.mp4?t=1793891257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>AUTOMATE THE PROCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn repetitive work into a system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect potatoes in bulk, use machines to process them, and automate more of the job as your operation grows.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":[" Golden Horn Studios"],"publishers":[" Golden Horn Studios"],"release_date":"3 Nov, 2026"}